From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:28:06 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] bcp47mrm: Add the DLL, with IsWellFormedTag and
 GetDistanceOfClosestLanguageInList.

The Windows App SDK's resource manager (Microsoft.Windows.ApplicationModel.Resources.dll)
imports IsWellFormedTag from bcp47mrm.dll and looks up GetDistanceOfClosestLanguageInList;
without them the file picker of programs that ship the SDK self-contained (Minecraft Bedrock)
fails. IsWellFormedTag checks the langtag syntax of RFC 5646 and its irregular grandfathered
tags, without the registry. GetDistanceOfClosestLanguageInList gives 1.0 for the same tag, 0.5
for the same language, and ERROR_NO_MATCH with 0.0 otherwise.

Original work for macrock (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

Topic: bcp47mrm
